It stars Jeff Bridges, Ellen Barkin, John Hurt, and Diane Lane, and
was released by United Artists on December 1, 1995.

14
01:20:42,352 --> 01:20:48,352
It was a box-office bomb, grossing $2.1 million on a budget of $30
million, and received mixed reviews from critics.

